What you say about infinite wishes would only work if you had the 9000 gp's to
start with (or at least ~6000) as I find that shopkeepers only have about 3000
gp's on them when I have killed them. Also, a limit could be placed on buying
wishes so that a shopkeeper may only sell 1 wish to a player. I think the price
would have to be *very* high, as this would mean a player could still get a wish
from every shopkeeper or keep polymorphing themselves to change name. If the price
is high enough it may be considered easier to kill a dragon for scale mail and buy
anything else you need :-)

